261	  /* Below 899px the composition stacks to one column and the poster rows alone
262	     exceed the viewport height a pin can borrow — see the matching CSS media
263	     query on .stage. Treat narrow the same as reduced motion for the engine:
264	     strip the act attributes BEFORE ScrollCraft.mount() runs, so it never
265	     claims heroAct as a pinned act and never forces its 300vh inline height.
266	     Left in place, that height survives .stage's own CSS override and leaves
267	     a dead, empty scroll track — the same failure F-001 named for reduced
268	     motion, just triggered by width instead of by the media feature. */
